{"kind":"table","sheet":"Client review","address":"A1:G15","rows":15,"cols":7,"values":[["Current internal reference","Product on stocktake","Stocktake quantity","What to check","Final internal reference","Quantity to import","Notes / changes needed"],["BDT80","**BARRYS DECAF TEABAGS 6X80PK",55,"There are two products with this code. One name ends in NEW. Which product does the count of 55 belong to? If both were counted, tell us the quantity for each.",null,null,null],["BFH130","**BARRATT FLUMP HEARTS 12X130G",1,"There are two Flump Hearts products with this code. One name ends in NEW PRODUCT. Which one was counted?",null,null,null],["BFS120","**BARRAT FRUIT SALAD SQ 12X120",11,"This code is used for Fruity Mix and Squishy Sunburst. Which product was counted?",null,null,null],["BT03","**BARRYS MASTER BLEND 6X80PK",20.33,"There are two Master Blend products with this code. One name ends in NEW PRODUCT. Which one was counted? Please also check the count of 20.33 and say whether it means cartons, packs or individual items.",null,null,null],["CM05","**CADBURY MINT CRISP 48X49G",16,"This code is used for both 48x49g and 48x54g Mint Crisp. The stocktake says 48x49g. Which pack size was counted?",null,null,null],["CO07S","**CLUB ORANGE SLIM 24X330ML",101,"There are two Odoo products with the same code and name. Which product does the count belong to? If both were counted, tell us the quantity for each.",null,null,null],["EC03","**ROSS ECR STICKS 24x6pk",1,"There are two Odoo products with the same code and name. Which product does the count belong to? If both were counted, tell us the quantity for each.",null,null,null],["GC01","**CADBURY GOLDEN CRISP 48X54G",20,"This code is used for both 48x49g and 48x54g Golden Crisp. The stocktake says 48x54g. Which pack size was counted?",null,null,null],["LFG130","LION FOOTBALL GUMS 12X130G",26,"There are two Football Gums products with this code. One name ends in BAG. Which one was counted? Were you counting cartons, bags or individual items?",null,null,null],["LLG130","LION LIQUORICE GUMS 12X130G",18,"There are two Liquorice Gums products with this code. One name ends in BAG. Which one was counted? Were you counting cartons, bags or individual items?",null,null,null],["LMG130","LION MIDGET GEMS 12X130G",24,"This code is used for Midget Gems BAG and Mini Gems. Which product was counted?",null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null],["Look up each current reference in Odoo. Either update the product references there, or explain the changes needed in Notes. Fill in Final internal reference and Quantity to import. Before import, each final reference must identify one product in Odoo. In Notes, identify the chosen product (add its Odoo link if names are identical), say whether you counted cartons, packs or items, and list each product's reference and quantity if the count needs splitting. Leave unchecked quantities blank; enter 0 only for no stock. Original quantities are from your 1 Oct stocktake. MISC is on Excluded.",null,null,null,null,null,null]]}
